  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JP DRC Fight against GBV - JAD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Programme Fight against Gender Based Violence Justice, Empowerment, and Dignity for Women and Girls in the Democratic Republic of Congo, contributes to the reduction of GBV. Initiatives are designed to shift socio-cultural attitudes and norms in favour of gender equal systems and services&#x2014;further empowering and increasing the resilience of survivors of gender-based violence.</narrative>
  </description>
